# Laptop cron — football-analytics-dbt scheduled ops
#
# Setup:
#   1. cp .env.example .env  (fill in Databricks + Gmail credentials)
#   2. chmod +x scripts/run_scheduled_ops.sh
#   3. crontab -e
#   4. Paste ONE line below (uncomment and keep your path)
#
# Logs: football-analytics-dbt/logs/scheduled_ops_*.log
#
# Schedule: 06:00 UTC daily = 09:00 in UTC+3 (Kenya/EAT)
# Change hour if your Databricks Job finishes at a different time.
# Mac cron uses your laptop's local timezone unless you set TZ in the line.

# Full ops (spike check + dbt triage if target/run_results.json exists):
0 9 * * * /Users/efuatutuwaa-ampofo/Desktop/dbt/football-analytics-dbt/scripts/run_scheduled_ops.sh

# If you prefer UTC explicitly:
# TZ=UTC 0 6 * * * /Users/efuatutuwaa-ampofo/Desktop/dbt/football-analytics-dbt/scripts/run_scheduled_ops.sh
